      "iosEvidence": "M0A-18 typed confirmation read consumer plus M0A-20 action consumer, M0A-21 post-action projection reconciliation and M0A-22 confirmation lease/authority-composition binding passed locally. Selected Extraction baseline typed parsing rejects mixed Candidate extraction IDs. M0A-24 adds a typed four-field boundary command that rejects open/free text and reuses the captured echoTextInput policy transport. M0A-25 adds its AccountLease/generation-fenced use case, validates lifecycle-compatible receipts, and discards stale deferred completions after account rebind. M0A-26 adds a QA-only, Release-compiled-out button surface and in-memory simulator smoke for skipOnce/cooldown/doNotAsk. M0A-28 adds a separate typed doNotAsk restore command, requires an in-app confirmation alert, preserves the AccountLease/generation fence, and verifies active/open reconciliation in the QA smoke. M0A-30 adds a separate typed cooldown restore client/use case that sends only commandId/threadId/expectedSessionVersion to the existing QA-only route, preserves AccountLease/generation fencing, and verifies active/open reconciliation in XCTest and simulator UIQA; Release compiles the control out.",
